[E-TAILREC] Error: `count` is marked @[tailrec], but 2 recursive calls aren't in tail position
    ╭─[ reject/tailrec-lifted-match.sw:13:17 ]
    │
 13 │       | None => count rest
    │                 ─────┬────  
    │                      ╰────── this `match` is not the last thing done, and its result is an operand of `+`, which runs after it returns
 14 │       | Some _ => count rest
    │                   ─────┬────  
    │                        ╰────── this `match` is not the last thing done, and its result is an operand of `+`, which runs after it returns
    │ 
    │ Note: a call is in tail position when its result is the function's result, with nothing left to do after it returns; then each call is a turn of a loop, not a new frame
────╯
